[36m(TaskRunner pid=1199197)[0m a_3 & = a_2 + a_1 = 3 + 2 = 5, \\
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1199197)[0m a_4 & = a_3 + a_2 = 5 + 3 = 8, \\
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1199197)[0m a_5 & = a_4 + a_3 = 8 + 5 = 13, \\
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1199197)[0m a_6 & = a_5 + a_4 = 13 + 8 = 21, \\
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1199197)[0m a_7 & = a_6 + a_5 = 21 + 13 = 34, \\
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1199197)[0m a_8 & = a_7 + a_6 = 34 + 21 = 55.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1199197)[0m \end{align*}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1199197)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1199197)[0m So, the number of ways to place 8 people in 16 chairs such that no two people are adjacent is \(a_8 = 55\).
